1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:03,625
Starting Treatment

2
00:00:03,625 --> 00:00:07,916
On the day of your CT planning scan,
the radiation therapist will give you

3
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:12,416
a preliminary schedule of your radiation
treatment days and times.

4
00:00:12,416 --> 00:00:16,166
You will return to the department
on the first day of treatment.

5
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:21,625
This first day will require a slightly
longer appointment than all the following

6
00:00:21,625 --> 00:00:26,416
days, as there are extra steps
for setup verification as well as time

7
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:30,541
with the nurses in our clinic
to go over other important information,

8
00:00:30,541 --> 00:00:34,916
such as things to do
and things to avoid while on treatment.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,833
More detailed instructions about this
first day

10
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:41,291
will be given to you by the therapist
and your doctor.

11
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:45,250
After that, depending
on your personalized treatment schedule,

12
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:48,708
you may come back for treatment daily
or every other day,

13
00:00:49,041 --> 00:00:52,041
or you may be done with treatment
altogether.

14
00:00:52,416 --> 00:00:56,500
While our nurses and staff will discuss
other specific instructions with you,

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,833
you can generally go about your day
as you would otherwise.

16
00:01:01,041 --> 00:01:06,041
Some individuals are concerned about
being around loved ones after treatment.

17
00:01:06,041 --> 00:01:08,625
It is important to note that you are not

18
00:01:08,625 --> 00:01:12,500
radioactive
after external beam radiation treatment.

19
00:01:12,916 --> 00:01:16,708
You may shower, but do not 
scrub the treated area.

20
00:01:16,708 --> 00:01:21,500
Avoid sun exposure to the treated area
and use sunscreen.

21
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,958
Your skin in the treatment
area will be more sensitive to the sun.

22
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:28,250
Up to a year after treatment is completed.

23
00:01:29,083 --> 00:01:33,416
Always remember that if you have
any questions throughout the journey,

24
00:01:33,416 --> 00:01:38,416
our staff is available to help answer
any questions or provide guidance.

25
00:01:38,625 --> 00:01:40,916
The journey can be very confusing,

26
00:01:40,916 --> 00:01:45,375
and our goal is to help
make this just a bit easier to understand.
